  "notes": "Refers to blocking or shielding from light. Very commonly seen as a modifier in compound terms for products and materials.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {遮光|しゃこう}カーテン — blackout curtain\n- {遮光|しゃこう}{性|せい} — light-blocking property\n- {遮光|しゃこう}レンズ — tinted/shaded lens\n- {遮光|しゃこう}フィルム — light-blocking film\n- {遮光|しゃこう}{率|りつ} — light-blocking rate\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {遮断|しゃだん} — blocking, shutting off (broader; used for sound, electricity, etc.)\n- {日除|ひよ}け — sunshade, awning (physical shade from the sun)",
